# Vercel Blob (stores rendered videos and the sandbox snapshot pointer).
#
# Preferred: Vercel OIDC. Create a Blob store (Dashboard -> Storage -> Create -> Blob) and
# connect it to the project. Vercel sets BLOB_STORE_ID and injects short-lived OIDC
# credentials automatically. For local development run `vercel link` and `vercel env pull`.
# BLOB_STORE_ID=
#
# Legacy fallback (only if BLOB_STORE_ID is not set):
# BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=
